message: "If you use the DPI Map data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "DPI Map: Digital Public Infrastructure Map"
abstract: >-
  Data on national-scale digital public infrastructure (DPI) around the world,
  collected by researchers at the UCL Institute for Innovation and Public Purpose:
  digital identity, payment and data exchange systems, by country or region,
  with the evidence and history behind each value.
